<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB leaves interest rates unchanged after meeting.</title>
<headline>SNB leaves interest rates unchanged after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) left key interest rates unchanged after today's policy-setting meeting, an SNB spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There wasn't any change,&quot; the spokesman said in response to an enquiry.</p>
<p>The SNB last Thursday lowered its discount rate by half a percentage point to 1.00 percent.</p>
<p>No change was expected at today's meeting. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
